  "title": "List colorings of edge-critical graphs",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture Suppose that $G$ is a $\\Delta$-edge-critical graph. Suppose that for each edge $e$ of $G$, there is a list $L(e)$ of $\\Delta$ colors. Then $G$ is $L$-edge-colorable unless all lists are equal to each other.",
